{"id":644,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为深化产教融合，拓宽毕业生就业渠道，直观对接行业一线岗位需求，7月13日，机械工程学院边国旗、李涛涛老师带领学生代表前往山西北方晋东化工有限公司包装材料分厂开展访企拓岗走访交流。该企业隶属于中国兵器工业集团特种能源集团，是国有重点装备化工企业。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9UzlAsol-DLNLDM1mCPLR6knmCiU4WmfnzLaolrVL4VfMRL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLShRoSh2nz-solLYUNWkL8rRU4V2LmAVUN-sMzUZnRMFLlM7oRTfUzQFMmCZMz7Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbMR9sgtA8pUNcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39487&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/901C9FE279C2BBB3ECC1F28EBB7548D3/1CD89AA6/66851\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9UzlAsol-DLNLDM1mCPLR6knmCiU4WmfnzLaolrVL4VfMRL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLShRoSh2nz-solLYUNWkL8rRU4V2LmAVUN-sMzUZnRMFLlM7oRTfUzQFMmCZMz7Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbMR9sgtA8pUNcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39487&e=.png\"></p><p>公司分厂厂长吴俊、助理张海龙、前副总经理杨文利，热情接待了师生，并组织专题交流会。会上企业负责人讲解企业发展布局、机械类岗位需求、招聘标准与职工成长体系，针对行业发展、职业规划等问题与到场学生互动答疑。边国旗、李涛涛老师介绍学院专业建设、人才培养模式与学生专业优势，双方围绕产学研协同发展等内容深入洽谈。学生深入了解了国企工作平台，明晰自身学习提升方向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9U4QARnRMkU4l8M1NCZUl7sU47PLNWm7MzlbM4QfM4AVUzl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPUYhVM1ybLmWfnNlinmL8nmrfnzVVM4M2UlU8Ml7iLzAFM474M8UsL4nFMNW7M7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbMR9sgtA8pUNcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39487&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B1CE6922AFE5F34F5AE1E73FAD45A518/7137D734/6BD4F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9U4QARnRMkU4l8M1NCZUl7sU47PLNWm7MzlbM4QfM4AVUzl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPUYhVM1ybLmWfnNlinmL8nmrfnzVVM4M2UlU8Ml7iLzAFM474M8UsL4nFMNW7M7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbMR9sgtA8pUNcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39487&e=.png\"></p><p>本次走访搭建校企双向交流桥梁，既丰富学生行业认知，也为学院拓展优质就业资源，助力毕业生实现高质量充分就业。</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9UzlAsol-DLNLDM1mCPLR6knmCiU4WmfnzLaolrVL4VfMRL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLShRoSh2nz-solLYUNWkL8rRU4V2LmAVUN-sMzUZnRMFLlM7oRTfUzQFMmCZMz7Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLPg4LbMR9sgtA8pUNcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1131&nid=39487&e=.png"}